{"logId": "10545aaf-899f-4b6f-8e7e-027f27827419", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [369, 121, 940, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[369.0, 121.0], [940.0, 121.0], [940.0, 165.0], [369.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与孩子平等相处的状态。（平等）", "block_bbox": [361, 230, 1590, 307], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[361.0, 230.0], [1590.0, 230.0], [1590.0, 307.0], [361.0, 307.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：父母有养育孩子的权利，但绝对不是占有的权利。孩子是属于他自己的、属于社会的，而非父母的私有，他拥有完整的人格和权利。懂得好的理念时，会超越传统观念下对待孩子的概念，用全新的眼光和视角对待孩子，与孩子是平等的生命和相处关系。除了养育的责任之外，更应该做的是让他们主宰自己的人生，不但父母没有负担、孩子也没有负担，传递给孩子的是平等、独立、个性、轻松和快乐。", "block_bbox": [362, 341, 1610, 507], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[362.0, 341.0], [1610.0, 341.0], [1610.0, 507.0], [362.0, 507.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [365, 553, 536, 586], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[365.0, 553.0], [536.0, 553.0], [536.0, 586.0], [365.0, 586.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、认知到孩子不是父母私有，更属于他自己和社会", "block_bbox": [389, 612, 992, 644], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 612.0], [992.0, 612.0], [992.0, 644.0], [389.0, 644.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不需要孩子对自己有任何回报，自己对孩子也没有任何期待和要求，让他/她用任何自己喜欢的方式生活\n3、家长和孩子几乎不存在不能沟通的话题", "block_bbox": [386, 656, 1609, 730], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[386.0, 656.0], [1609.0, 656.0], [1609.0, 730.0], [386.0, 730.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、子女18岁以后或学业完成后独立居住生存，父母不应向孩子提供生活费用（在孩子能够支付房租和满足生存之前，允许孩子暂时通过借款形式进行资助）", "block_bbox": [389, 742, 1610, 817], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 742.0], [1610.0, 742.0], [1610.0, 817.0], [389.0, 817.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、父母不给子女置办婚房、彩礼嫁妆，不替子女支付房贷、车贷等", "block_bbox": [389, 828, 1175, 861], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 828.0], [1175.0, 828.0], [1175.0, 861.0], [389.0, 861.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、孩子应由夫妻双方抚养和教育，不让老人帮带孩子", "block_bbox": [389, 872, 1018, 904], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 872.0], [1018.0, 872.0], [1018.0, 904.0], [389.0, 904.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[71]", "block_bbox": [967, 970, 1021, 996], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[967.0, 970.0], [1020.0, 970.0], [1020.0, 995.0], [967.0, 995.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.852725625038147, "coordinate": [369, 121, 940, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[369.0, 121.0], [940.0, 121.0], [940.0, 165.0], [369.0, 165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6055769920349121, "coordinate": [361, 230, 1590, 307], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[361.0, 230.0], [1590.0, 230.0], [1590.0, 307.0], [361.0, 307.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9558620452880859, "coordinate": [362, 341, 1610, 507], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[362.0, 341.0], [1610.0, 341.0], [1610.0, 507.0], [362.0, 507.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8107844591140747, "coordinate": [365, 553, 536, 586], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[365.0, 553.0], [536.0, 553.0], [536.0, 586.0], [365.0, 586.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7597370743751526, "coordinate": [389, 612, 992, 644], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 612.0], [992.0, 612.0], [992.0, 644.0], [389.0, 644.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5808548927307129, "coordinate": [386, 655, 1610, 688], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[386.0, 655.0], [1610.0, 655.0], [1610.0, 688.0], [386.0, 688.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.3187134265899658, "coordinate": [386, 656, 1609, 730], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[386.0, 656.0], [1609.0, 656.0], [1609.0, 730.0], [386.0, 730.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5423247218132019, "coordinate": [389, 699, 888, 731], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 699.0], [888.0, 699.0], [888.0, 731.0], [389.0, 731.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9140853881835938, "coordinate": [389, 742, 1610, 817], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 742.0], [1610.0, 742.0], [1610.0, 817.0], [389.0, 817.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7872691750526428, "coordinate": [389, 828, 1175, 861], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 828.0], [1175.0, 828.0], [1175.0, 861.0], [389.0, 861.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7483165860176086, "coordinate": [389, 872, 1018, 904], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 872.0], [1018.0, 872.0], [1018.0, 904.0], [389.0, 904.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7235525846481323, "coordinate": [967, 970, 1021, 996], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[967.0, 970.0], [1020.0, 970.0], [1020.0, 995.0], [967.0, 995.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）\n\n## 四 级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与孩子平等相处的状态。（平等）\n\n- 本条释义：父母有养育孩子的权利，但绝对不是占有的权利。孩子是属于他自己的、属于社会的，而非父母的私有，他拥有完整的人格和权利。懂得好的理念时，会超越传统观念下对待孩子的概念，用全新的眼光和视角对待孩子，与孩子是平等的生命和相处关系。除了养育的责任之外，更应该做的是让他们主宰自己的人生，不但父母没有负担、孩子也没有负担，传递给孩子的是平等、独立、个性、轻松和快乐。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、认知到孩子不是父母私有，更属于他自己和社会\n\n2、不需要孩子对自己有任何回报，自己对孩子也没有任何期待和要求，让他/她用任何自己喜欢的方式生活\n\n3、家长和孩子几乎不存在不能沟通的话题\n\n4、子女18岁以后或学业完成后独立居住生存，父母不应向孩子提供生活费用（在孩子能够支付房租和满足生存之前，允许孩子暂时通过借款形式进行资助）\n\n5、父母不给子女置办婚房、彩礼嫁妆，不替子女支付房贷、车贷等\n\n6、孩子应由夫妻双方抚养和教育，不让老人帮带孩子", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//10545aaf-899f-4b6f-8e7e-027f27827419/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A38%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F7e79c3ddaeb639171a32ca3eccc82a257d92c7387a91c2ab2ebae0e4e87549f6"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//10545aaf-899f-4b6f-8e7e-027f27827419/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A38%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F5c18b411068ef0f51cbbe516b792a5d959d075eeb0b7e22f9c6572fd512935e2"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//10545aaf-899f-4b6f-8e7e-027f27827419/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A38%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F4a0cb5f1dfe112fb0dd96bb8f7615e6c5645e29422201d9089418f5f75eb8e43"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
